WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.592
"Hurry!" the princess cried to the children.

2
00:00:06.593 --> 00:00:08.998
"I have been gone too long!

3
00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:12.922
By now the servants will be looking for me!"

4
00:00:12.923 --> 00:00:19.302
When they reached a courtyard, several servants rushed toward the princess.

5
00:00:19.303 --> 00:00:23.630
"Where have you been, Your Highness?" cried one woman.

6
00:00:23.631 --> 00:00:27.708
"Your Highness!" Another servant gasped.

7
00:00:27.709 --> 00:00:30.146
"Who are these strangers?

8
00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:32.426
Did they kidnap you?"

9
00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:37.578
"No, they did not kidnap me!" the princess replied.

10
00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:40.609
"They helped me," she added.

11
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:43.704
"And now they are my honored guests."

12
00:00:43.705 --> 00:00:47.650
The servants did not look happy to hear this.

13
00:00:47.651 --> 00:00:52.168
But they bowed quietly and then stepped aside.

14
00:00:52.169 --> 00:00:56.839
The children followed the princess into a small building.

15
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:01.305
She invited them to sit around a low table.

16
00:01:01.306 --> 00:01:06.179
Then she left for a moment to change her clothing.

17
00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:10.737
Mandy noticed a sheet of paper with unusual writing.

18
00:01:10.738 --> 00:01:13.788
"Are these Chinese characters?"

19
00:01:13.789 --> 00:01:16.829
she asked when the princess returned.

20
00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:20.086
"No," said the princess.

21
00:01:20.087 --> 00:01:24.820
"That is Hangeul, the alphabet that my father invented."

22
00:01:24.821 --> 00:01:29.641
"Your father invented an alphabet?" said Mandy.

23
00:01:29.642 --> 00:01:32.766
"Yes," said the princess.

24
00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:36.267
"Our people have always spoken in Korean.

25
00:01:36.268 --> 00:01:40.368
But they used Chinese characters to read and write.

26
00:01:40.369 --> 00:01:44.245
Chinese characters were very difficult to learn.

27
00:01:44.246 --> 00:01:48.498
And only nobles could go to school to learn them."

28
00:01:48.499 --> 00:01:52.021
"That's not fair!" Mandy said.

29
00:01:52.022 --> 00:01:55.319
"I agree," said the princess.

30
00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.591
"My father didn't think it was fair either.

31
00:01:58.592 --> 00:02:03.834
That is why he worked with scholars to invent a simple alphabet.

32
00:02:03.835 --> 00:02:06.804
Hangeul is very easy to learn.

33
00:02:06.805 --> 00:02:10.509
And now the Korean people have their own alphabet."

34
00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:16.083
"It sounds like your father was a great king," said Mandy.

35
00:02:16.084 --> 00:02:22.403
"He was. And he loved his people very much," replied the princess.

36
00:02:22.404 --> 00:02:25.833
"But Hangeul has not spread to everyone yet.

37
00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:28.913
Some people are upset by Hangeul.

38
00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:33.592
They say that learning is only for nobles and royalty."

39
00:02:33.593 --> 00:02:37.833
The princess pulled out a clean sheet of paper.

40
00:02:37.834 --> 00:02:42.402
"Now I will show you just how beautiful Hangeul is!"

41
00:02:42.403 --> 00:02:46.807
The princess poured water into the inkstone.

42
00:02:46.808 --> 00:02:54.140
Then she made ink, dipped a brush into it, and wrote two Hangeul letters.

43
00:02:54.141 --> 00:02:55.426
"Here you are."

44
00:02:55.427 --> 00:02:58.084
She gave the paper to Vinnie.

45
00:02:58.085 --> 00:03:00.536
"This says Vi-nnie.

46
00:03:00.537 --> 00:03:02.284
For your name!"

47
00:03:02.285 --> 00:03:05.278
"Thank you!" said Vinnie.

48
00:03:05.279 --> 00:03:11.484
Next the princess wrote Mandy's and Gildong's names in Hangeul too.

49
00:03:11.485 --> 00:03:15.066
Gildong was very pleased by the gift.

50
00:03:15.067 --> 00:03:17.037
"Thank you, Princess.

51
00:03:17.038 --> 00:03:19.174
I will remember this.

52
00:03:19.175 --> 00:03:22.202
I hope I get to learn Hangeul soon."

53
00:03:22.203 --> 00:03:27.298
"I think you will, Gildong," she said with a smile.

54
00:03:27.299 --> 00:03:30.846
Just then there was a sound at the door.

55
00:03:30.847 --> 00:03:34.202
A servant spoke in a worried voice.

56
00:03:34.203 --> 00:03:38.159
"Your Highness! The guards are coming!

57
00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:45.015
And they are looking for your friends!"

